<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy | UBR Esports</title>
    <meta name="description" content="UBR Esports privacy policy detailing how your data and account information are safely handled.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/terms.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/nav.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-shell">
        <%- include("../partials/nav") %>

        <main class="terms-page">
            <div class="card">
                <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="meta">Last Updated: August 2026</p>
                <p>At UBR Esports, we are dedicated to safeguarding your personal data and ensuring complete transparency in how information is collected, used, and protected across our platform.</p>

                <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
                <p>When participating in scrims, tournaments, or utilizing wallet services, we may collect basic details including your name, email address, in-game BGMI Character ID, and payment identifier (UPI ID) solely for tournament prize disbursements.</p>

                <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
                <p>Your details are used strictly to verify tournament rosters, process prize withdrawals, maintain fair play leaderboards, and communicate important match schedules.</p>

                <h3>3. Data Protection & Sharing</h3>
                <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your private details to any third-party advertisers. All transaction and withdrawal data is securely handled with standard encryption protocols.</p>

                <h3>4. Cookies & Preferences</h3>
                <p>We use session cookies and local storage only to enhance user login state and remember platform preferences for a seamless gaming experience.</p>

                <h3>5. Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h3>
                <p>If you have any questions regarding your data or wish to request account deletion, please reach out directly at <a href="mailto:ubresport@gmail.com">ubresport@gmail.com</a>.</p>
            </div>
        </main>

        <%- include("../partials/footer") %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
